From 7be6ece5f00b10297dac32fc9a3aaf7045fb053a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Armada <noreply@armada.local>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 13:13:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] armada: gate SM8550 native-sleep workarounds at boot

Require sm8550.ns=1 on an SM8550 machine before enabling the
experimental suspend behavior.

Keep the pre-series DWC eligibility test and existing Qualcomm PCIe
suspend path when the gate is off so merely carrying the patch stack
does not opt other platforms into D3cold.
